msgctxt "512"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_"
"LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret> to control where Kiryu "
"looks.\r\n"
"This is your big chance to feast your eyes on a perfect incarnation of "
"beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> when you want to focus intently on one "
"of her features. Holding down <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> allows you to "
"focus your gaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Note that her response will change depending on where you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "(She's got these large, beautiful eyes...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "(Her lips are so full and glossy...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "(Those delicate hands...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(Maybe those fishnet stockings...? They're... something.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(I'm actually starting to get pretty fond of her hair...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "(Her chest, maybe...? Can I even say that?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Hmm... Decisions, decisions...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "I'm gonna go with your eyes. They're stunning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Really? I always thought they were overpowering..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"That's what I like, though. I get lost in your eyes every time you look at "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "You're kidding me, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "I kid you not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Still... You don't have to stare at me like that... It makes me all "
"nervous! <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "You've got some nice lips."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"And that mole right there is the perfect accent to that perfectly shaped "
"mouth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Haha, so I've heard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"They say that people with a mole near their mouth won't any have trouble "
